HASHING 




Hashing is a technique used to store and retrieve data efficiently using a key-value structure.

Java Collections Used

* HashMap
* HashSet

Important HashMap Methods
map.put(key, value);
map.get(key);
map.containsKey(key);
map.getOrDefault(key, 0);


